   "text": "Comparative Growing Trials\nAll characteristics described below are from comparative\ngrowing trials conducted at Box Hill North in Victoria, All\nplants used were grown on their own roots, initially in\ncontainers in a pine bark/scoria mix for 12 months\noutdoors, and later transferred into the ground 50 cm\napart in October 1990. Measurements are from 20 plants\nselected at random and were taken in the first week of\nApril, 1991.",
