     "bbox": [
      305.28,
      613.44,
      525.6,
      622.08
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose. It is"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.32,
      623.52,
      540.0,
      631.68
     ],
     "text": "distinct from other known varieties in having the following"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.32,
      633.12,
      527.04,
      640.32
     ],
     "text": "combination of characters: whole bloom closest to RHS"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.32,
      643.68,
      497.76,
      651.84
     ],
     "text": "44B; petal basal spot present only on the inside."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Diagnosis\n\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose. It is\ndistinct from other known varieties in having the following\ncombination of characters: whole bloom closest to RHS\n44B; petal basal spot present only on the inside.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
